{"seq":2,"slug":"navigation-compose","title":"Navigation Compose 进阶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/architecture/navigation-compose","wordCount":417,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"navigation-compose-进阶\">Navigation Compose 进阶</h1><p>Navigation Compose 从 2.7 版本引入类型安全路由（Type-safe routes），在 2.8+ 完全稳定。结合 Kotlin Serialization，路由定义从字符串模板演进为 <code>@Serializable</code> 数据类——编译期检查参数类型、IDE 自动补全、重构安全。本文深入 Navigation Compose 的类型安全机制、嵌套导航图设计、深度链接处理以及与 Compose 动画系统的集成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Navigation Compose 的架构分三层：<code>NavHost</code>（容器）、<code>NavGraph</code>（路由表）、<code>NavController</code>（状态持有者）。类型安全路由将传统的字符串路径替换为序列化对象。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[NavHost] --&gt; B[NavGraph]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;composable&lt;Route&gt; { }&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;navigation&lt;Graph&gt; { }&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;composable&lt;SubRoute&gt; { }&quot;]&#10;    F[NavController] --&gt;|navigate| B&#10;    F --&gt;|popBackStack| B&#10;    G[&quot;@Serializable Route&quot;] --&gt;|序列化| H[&quot;URL 路径&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt;|反序列化| G\">graph TD\n    A[NavHost] --&gt; B[NavGraph]\n    B --&gt; C[\"composable&lt;Route&gt; { }\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"navigation&lt;Graph&gt; { }\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"composable&lt;SubRoute&gt; { }\"]\n    F[NavController] --&gt;|navigate| B\n    F --&gt;|popBackStack| B\n    G[\"@Serializable Route\"] --&gt;|序列化| H[\"URL 路径\"]\n    H --&gt;|反序列化| G</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>2.8+ 变化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>NavController</code></td>\n<td>管理回退栈、执行导航</td>\n<td><code>navigate(route: T)</code> 接受对象而非字符串</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NavHost</code></td>\n<td>渲染当前目的地</td>\n<td>支持 <code>enterTransition</code>/<code>exitTransition</code> 全局配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NavGraph</code></td>\n<td>声明路由表</td>\n<td><code>composable&lt;T&gt;</code> 泛型重载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Route</td>\n<td>路由定义</td>\n<td><code>@Serializable data class/object</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NavType</code></td>\n<td>参数类型映射</td>\n<td>自动从 <code>@Serializable</code> 推断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"类型安全路由定义\">类型安全路由定义</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 路由定义：使用 @Serializable 注解&#10;@Serializable&#10;object Home  // 无参数的路由&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class UserDetail(val userId: String)  // 必选参数&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class Search(&#10;    val query: String = &quot;&quot;,     // 可选参数（有默认值）&#10;    val category: String? = null  // 可空参数&#10;)&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class ProductList(&#10;    val ids: List&lt;Int&gt;  // 复杂类型参数&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 路由定义：使用 @Serializable 注解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object Home  // 无参数的路由</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class UserDetail(val userId: String)  // 必选参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class Search(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val query: String = \"\",     // 可选参数（有默认值）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val category: String? = null  // 可空参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class ProductList(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val ids: List&#x3C;Int>  // 复杂类型参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"navhost-与路由注册\">NavHost 与路由注册</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun AppNavigation() {&#10;    val navController = rememberNavController()&#10;&#10;    NavHost(&#10;        navController = navController,&#10;        startDestination = Home,&#10;        enterTransition = { fadeIn(animationSpec = tween(300)) },&#10;        exitTransition = { fadeOut(animationSpec = tween(300)) }&#10;    ) {&#10;        composable&lt;Home&gt; {&#10;            HomeScreen(&#10;                onUserClick = { userId -&gt;&#10;                    navController.navigate(UserDetail(userId))&#10;                },&#10;                onSearch = { query -&gt;&#10;                    navController.navigate(Search(query = query))&#10;                }&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        composable&lt;UserDetail&gt; { backStackEntry -&gt;&#10;            val route = backStackEntry.toRoute&lt;UserDetail&gt;()&#10;            UserDetailScreen(userId = route.userId)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        composable&lt;Search&gt;(&#10;            enterTransition = { slideInHorizontally { it } },&#10;            exitTransition = { slideOutHorizontally { it } }&#10;        ) { backStackEntry -&gt;&#10;            val route = backStackEntry.toRoute&lt;Search&gt;()&#10;            SearchScreen(&#10;                initialQuery = route.query,&#10;                category = route.category&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AppNavigation() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val navController = rememberNavController()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    NavHost(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        navController = navController,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        startDestination = Home,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        enterTransition = { fadeIn(animationSpec = tween(300)) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        exitTransition = { fadeOut(animationSpec = tween(300)) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;Home> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            HomeScreen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onUserClick = { userId -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    navController.navigate(UserDetail(userId))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onSearch = { query -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    navController.navigate(Search(query = query))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;UserDetail> { backStackEntry -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val route = backStackEntry.toRoute&#x3C;UserDetail>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            UserDetailScreen(userId = route.userId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;Search>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            enterTransition = { slideInHorizontally { it } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            exitTransition = { slideOutHorizontally { it } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) { backStackEntry -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val route = backStackEntry.toRoute&#x3C;Search>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            SearchScreen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                initialQuery = route.query,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                category = route.category</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"嵌套导航图\">嵌套导航图</h2><p>大型应用通常按功能模块拆分导航图：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 顶层导航图&#10;@Serializable object AuthGraph&#10;@Serializable object MainGraph&#10;&#10;NavHost(navController = navController, startDestination = AuthGraph) {&#10;    // 认证流程子图&#10;    navigation&lt;AuthGraph&gt;(startDestination = Login) {&#10;        composable&lt;Login&gt; { LoginScreen(...) }&#10;        composable&lt;Register&gt; { RegisterScreen(...) }&#10;        composable&lt;ForgotPassword&gt; { ForgotPasswordScreen(...) }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 主界面子图&#10;    navigation&lt;MainGraph&gt;(startDestination = Home) {&#10;        composable&lt;Home&gt; { HomeScreen(...) }&#10;        composable&lt;UserDetail&gt; { ... }&#10;&#10;        // 设置流程再嵌套&#10;        navigation&lt;SettingsGraph&gt;(startDestination = SettingsMain) {&#10;            composable&lt;SettingsMain&gt; { ... }&#10;            composable&lt;SettingsNotification&gt; { ... }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 模块化：各模块提供自己的导航图扩展函数&#10;// feature-settings/navigation.kt&#10;fun NavGraphBuilder.settingsGraph(navController: NavController) {&#10;    navigation&lt;SettingsGraph&gt;(startDestination = SettingsMain) {&#10;        composable&lt;SettingsMain&gt; { ... }&#10;        composable&lt;SettingsNotification&gt; { ... }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 顶层导航图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable object AuthGraph</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable object MainGraph</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>NavHost(navController = navController, startDestination = AuthGraph) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 认证流程子图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    navigation&#x3C;AuthGraph>(startDestination = Login) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;Login> { LoginScreen(...) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;Register> { RegisterScreen(...) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;ForgotPassword> { ForgotPasswordScreen(...) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 主界面子图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    navigation&#x3C;MainGraph>(startDestination = Home) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;Home> { HomeScreen(...) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;UserDetail> { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 设置流程再嵌套</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        navigation&#x3C;SettingsGraph>(startDestination = SettingsMain) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            composable&#x3C;SettingsMain> { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            composable&#x3C;SettingsNotification> { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 模块化：各模块提供自己的导航图扩展函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// feature-settings/navigation.kt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun NavGraphBuilder.settingsGraph(navController: NavController) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    navigation&#x3C;SettingsGraph>(startDestination = SettingsMain) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;SettingsMain> { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;SettingsNotification> { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"深度链接处理\">深度链接处理</h2><p>类型安全路由自动支持深度链接映射：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"composable&lt;UserDetail&gt;(&#10;    deepLinks = listOf(&#10;        navDeepLink&lt;UserDetail&gt;(&#10;            basePath = &quot;https://myapp.com/user&quot;&#10;        )&#10;    )&#10;) { backStackEntry -&gt;&#10;    val route = backStackEntry.toRoute&lt;UserDetail&gt;()&#10;    UserDetailScreen(userId = route.userId)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 对应的 URL：https://myapp.com/user/{userId}&#10;// 参数自动从 URL path/query 中解析&#10;&#10;// AndroidManifest.xml 中声明 intent-filter&#10;// &lt;data android:scheme=&quot;https&quot; android:host=&quot;myapp.com&quot; /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>composable&#x3C;UserDetail>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    deepLinks = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        navDeepLink&#x3C;UserDetail>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            basePath = \"https://myapp.com/user\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) { backStackEntry -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val route = backStackEntry.toRoute&#x3C;UserDetail>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    UserDetailScreen(userId = route.userId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 对应的 URL：https://myapp.com/user/{userId}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 参数自动从 URL path/query 中解析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// AndroidManifest.xml 中声明 intent-filter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// &#x3C;data android:scheme=\"https\" android:host=\"myapp.com\" /></span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"导航结果回传\">导航结果回传</h2><p>Compose Navigation 支持通过 <code>SavedStateHandle</code> 回传结果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 在目标页面设置结果&#10;@Composable&#10;fun ColorPickerScreen(navController: NavController) {&#10;    val colors = listOf(Color.Red, Color.Green, Color.Blue)&#10;    LazyColumn {&#10;        items(colors) { color -&gt;&#10;            ColorItem(color) {&#10;                navController.previousBackStackEntry&#10;                    ?.savedStateHandle&#10;                    ?.set(&quot;selected_color&quot;, color.toArgb())&#10;                navController.popBackStack()&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 在调用页面接收结果&#10;@Composable&#10;fun SettingsScreen(navController: NavController) {&#10;    val selectedColor = navController.currentBackStackEntry&#10;        ?.savedStateHandle&#10;        ?.getStateFlow&lt;Int?&gt;(&quot;selected_color&quot;, null)&#10;        ?.collectAsState()&#10;&#10;    Button(onClick = { navController.navigate(ColorPicker) }) {&#10;        Text(&quot;选择颜色&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    selectedColor?.value?.let { argb -&gt;&#10;        Box(Modifier.size(48.dp).background(Color(argb)))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在目标页面设置结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ColorPickerScreen(navController: NavController) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val colors = listOf(Color.Red, Color.Green, Color.Blue)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LazyColumn {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        items(colors) { color -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ColorItem(color) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                navController.previousBackStackEntry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    ?.savedStateHandle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    ?.set(\"selected_color\", color.toArgb())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                navController.popBackStack()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在调用页面接收结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun SettingsScreen(navController: NavController) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val selectedColor = navController.currentBackStackEntry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ?.savedStateHandle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ?.getStateFlow&#x3C;Int?>(\"selected_color\", null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ?.collectAsState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Button(onClick = { navController.navigate(ColorPicker) }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(\"选择颜色\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    selectedColor?.value?.let { argb -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Box(Modifier.size(48.dp).background(Color(argb)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与-bottom-navigation-集成\">与 Bottom Navigation 集成</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun MainScreen() {&#10;    val navController = rememberNavController()&#10;&#10;    Scaffold(&#10;        bottomBar = {&#10;            NavigationBar {&#10;                val navBackStackEntry by navController.currentBackStackEntryAsState()&#10;                val currentRoute = navBackStackEntry?.toRoute&lt;Any&gt;()&#10;&#10;                bottomNavItems.forEach { item -&gt;&#10;                    NavigationBarItem(&#10;                        selected = currentRoute == item.route,&#10;                        onClick = {&#10;                            navController.navigate(item.route) {&#10;                                popUpTo(navController.graph.startDestinationId) {&#10;                                    saveState = true&#10;                                }&#10;                                launchSingleTop = true&#10;                                restoreState = true&#10;                            }&#10;                        },&#10;                        icon = { Icon(item.icon, contentDescription = null) },&#10;                        label = { Text(item.label) }&#10;                    )&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    ) { padding -&gt;&#10;        NavHost(&#10;            navController = navController,&#10;            startDestination = Home,&#10;            modifier = Modifier.padding(padding)&#10;        ) { /* ... */ }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun MainScreen() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val navController = rememberNavController()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Scaffold(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bottomBar = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            NavigationBar {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val navBackStackEntry by navController.currentBackStackEntryAsState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val currentRoute = navBackStackEntry?.toRoute&#x3C;Any>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                bottomNavItems.forEach { item -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    NavigationBarItem(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        selected = currentRoute == item.route,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        onClick = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            navController.navigate(item.route) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                popUpTo(navController.graph.startDestinationId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                    saveState = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                launchSingleTop = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                restoreState = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        icon = { Icon(item.icon, contentDescription = null) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        label = { Text(item.label) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) { padding -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        NavHost(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            navController = navController,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            startDestination = Home,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier.padding(padding)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) { /* ... */ }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Navigation Compose 2.8+ 用 <code>@Serializable</code> 对象替代字符串路由，获得编译期类型安全</li>\n<li>嵌套导航图（<code>navigation&lt;T&gt;</code>）将路由按功能模块隔离，支持多模块架构</li>\n<li>深度链接通过 <code>navDeepLink&lt;T&gt;(basePath)</code> 自动映射 URL 参数到路由字段</li>\n<li>结果回传使用 <code>SavedStateHandle</code> 在 BackStackEntry 间传递数据</li>\n<li>Bottom Navigation 通过 <code>saveState</code>/<code>restoreState</code> 实现标签页状态保持</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"side-effects-lifecycle\">副作用与生命周期</a>——导航目的地的 Composition 生命周期如何影响副作用</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../android-development/jetpack-compose/navigation-compose\">Android 开发基础 · Navigation Compose</a>——Navigation Compose 基础用法</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../kotlin-advanced/idioms-and-best-practices/serialization\">Kotlin 进阶 · Serialization</a>——@Serializable 注解与 Kotlin Serialization 原理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Navigation Compose 进阶","id":"navigation-compose-进阶"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"类型安全路由定义","id":"类型安全路由定义"},{"level":2,"text":"NavHost 与路由注册","id":"navhost-与路由注册"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌套导航图","id":"嵌套导航图"},{"level":2,"text":"深度链接处理","id":"深度链接处理"},{"level":2,"text":"导航结果回传","id":"导航结果回传"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Bottom Navigation 集成","id":"与-bottom-navigation-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"副作用与